  "thag16.6:16.2": "",
  "thag16.6:16.3": "",
  "thag16.6:16.4": "The “dark class” refers to those born in an unfortunate state (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.57/en/sujato#11.1'>AN 6.57:11.1</a>). Sela is saying that the Buddha’s path is for everyone, not just the fortunate. ",
